menu "KVS WebRTC Configuration"

    config ENABLE_DATA_CHANNEL
        bool "Enable Data channel support using usrsctp"
        default y
        help
            Enables WebRTC Data channel support

    config USE_ESP_TLS_FOR_KVS
        bool "Use ESP-TLS for KVS TLS connections (TURN over TLS)"
        default y
        help
            Use ESP-TLS implementation instead of direct mbedTLS for TLS connections.
            This enables the use of ESP certificate bundle for CA verification,
            eliminating the need for certificate files on the filesystem.
            Recommended for ESP platforms to avoid certificate management complexity.

    config KVS_WEBRTC_MEDIA_DIAG_LOG
        bool "Verbose media diagnostics (per-frame FPS/drop-reason + PTS logs)"
        default n
        help
            Emit the periodic media diagnostics from kvs_media (send FPS,
            per-reason frame-drop counters, audio PTS vs counter drift). Useful
            when bringing up a new board/pipeline or debugging why frames aren't
            flowing; off by default since it logs every couple of seconds.
endmenu
